  "narrative": {
    "text": "Figure 2, ODRL Constraint Relationships: a Rule reaches constraints in four ways. Its assignee is a PartyCollection, its target an AssetCollection and its action an Action, and each of these has a refinement to one or more Constraints or LogicalConstraints. The Rule's own constraint property points to Constraints or LogicalConstraints directly. In every row a LogicalConstraint points back to the Constraints it combines. Stacked boxes mean one or more.",
